# 《The Inn》简体中文翻译 · characters/girls

translate simplified_chinese strings:

    old "A bright and cheerful girl. Linda is always ready to lend a helping hand whenever you need (in more ways than one). She's the first person {} meets when he arrives at the village."
    new "开朗活泼的女孩。无论何时你需要帮忙，琳达总是第一个伸出援手（方式可能不止一种）。{}来到村子时，遇见的第一个人就是她。"

    old "The owner of the foster care home where {} and the girls grown up. Kind and caring, she emanate a motherly aura even though she never had children."
    new "{}和姑娘们长大的那家寄养之家的主人。她和蔼可亲，即使从未生育，也散发着母性的光辉。"

    old "The youngest of the girls who lived in the same foster care home as {}. B-but, i-it's not like she likes {} or anything... B-baka!"
    new "和{}住在同一间寄养之家里最年幼的女孩。才、才不是说她喜欢{}什么的呢……笨、笨蛋！"

    old "The older girl who lived in the same foster care home as {}. Valentina (or Val) is an energetic girl. She likes to work out a lot and it shows. A teaser by nature, she knows how to use her sex appeal to get what she wants."
    new "和{}住在同一间寄养之家里年长一些的女孩。瓦伦蒂娜（也就是瓦伦）是个精力充沛的姑娘。她很喜欢锻炼，而且一眼就能看出来。她天生爱撩人，很懂得利用自己的魅力得到想要的东西。"

    old "Val's best friend. They met at college and took a liking to each other from the start. Jess is a lively and frisky girl, always enjoying flaunting her body. Apparently she's strong to alcohol but very weak to compliments."
    new "瓦伦最好的朋友。两人在大学相识，一见如故。杰西是个活泼又爱闹的姑娘，总爱炫耀自己的身体。听说她酒量很好，却抵挡不住几句赞美。"

    old "Linda's Friend from College. A somewhat mysterious girl that has recently reconnected with Linda."
    new "琳达的大学朋友。一个有些神秘的姑娘，最近才重新和琳达取得联系。"

    old "Cindy is a strange girl... She enjoys working out a lot, she actually got into it thanks to Val, who she has as her role model. Cindy also has some problems socializing, especially to people she doesn't know, which makes her seem as kind of a loner sometimes."
    new "辛迪是个奇怪的姑娘……她很喜欢锻炼，其实是受瓦伦影响才开始的，瓦伦一直是她的榜样。辛迪在人际交往上也有点问题，尤其是面对陌生人时，因此有时看上去有些孤僻。"

    old "The Music Teacher at Ouran High School and College and Frauke Mann's long time friend and confidant. She's a strict teacher that doesn't take kindly to any of her students' antics. {} used to have a massive crush on her when he studied there, maybe he still has, who knows?"
    new "欧兰高中暨学院的音乐老师，也是芙劳克·曼恩多年的好友与知己。她是一位严格的老师，对学生们的胡闹毫不容忍。{}当年在那儿读书时曾非常迷恋她，也许现在还是，谁知道呢？"

    old "The Security Guard at Ouran High School and College and Clara Hardmead's long time friend and confidant. A strong and tall woman, towering over most men. She hides a secret that she's ashamed of."
    new "欧兰高中暨学院的保安，也是克拉拉·哈德米德多年的好友与知己。她身材高大强壮，比大多数男人都高出一个头。她藏着一个令自己羞愧的秘密。"

    old "Luana's college friend. One of the few who Luana can somewhat tolerate. Flashy, loud and smuggy, she's a great company to have if you just want to have a fun time. She has a twin sister who already finished college."
    new "卢安娜的大学朋友，也是少数几个卢安娜勉强能忍受的人之一。她爱炫、话多又得意扬扬，如果你只想找点乐子，她会是个很好的玩伴。她还有个双胞胎姐姐，已经大学毕业了。"

    old "A gynoid created by Mr. Jacob decades ago. She was put on stand-by and all but forgotten in an old lab underneath building until she was discovered and reactivated by {} and Linda."
    new "雅各布先生数十年前制造的人形机娘。她被置于待命状态，在宅邸地下的旧实验室里几乎被彻底遗忘，直到被{}和琳达发现并重新启动。"

    old "A new arrival at Cudomundópolis' local church. A young Sister hailed directly from Italy to carry on with her predecessor's mission."
    new "库多蒙多波利斯当地教会的新成员。一位年轻修女，直接从意大利而来，要接续前任的使命。"

    old "Livya"
    new "莉芙娅"

    old "A Police Officer and John's sister, stoic and no-nonsense. She's on a personal mission to expose the Peccati family and take revenge on her father's death."
    new "一名警察，约翰的姐姐，沉稳干练、不讲废话。她正为着一个私人目标揭露佩卡蒂家族，并为父亲的死复仇。"
